2026-01-01 setup
  p  1 EUR
  p:s  2 EUR
  q  -3 EUR

2026-01-02 spaces around the equals signs are free
  p  0 EUR=1 EUR
  p  0 EUR =1 EUR
  p  0 EUR= 1 EUR
  p  0 EUR   =   1 EUR
  p		0 EUR	= 1 EUR
  p  0 EUR = 1 EUR  ; comment after the assertion
  p  0 EUR = 1 EUR; comment with no space
  q  0 EUR

2026-01-03 the four kinds
  p  0 EUR = 1 EUR
  p  0 EUR == 1 EUR
  p  0 EUR =* 3 EUR
  p  0 EUR ==* 3 EUR
  p  0 EUR =*3 EUR
  p  0 EUR ==*3 EUR
  p  0 EUR ==1 EUR
  q  0 EUR

2026-01-04 the asserted amount is a normal amount
  p  0 EUR = 1.00 EUR
  p  0 EUR = EUR 1
  p  0 EUR = +1 EUR
  p  0 EUR = "EUR" 1
  p  0 EUR = 100e-2 EUR
  p  0 EUR = 0.01e2 EUR
  p  0 EUR = 1,0 EUR
  p  0 EUR = 1 EUR @ 0.5 USD
  p  0 EUR = 1 EUR @@ 7 USD
  q  0 EUR

2026-01-05 a status mark and a virtual posting
  * p  0 EUR = 1 EUR
  ! p  0 EUR == 1 EUR
  (p)  0 EUR = 1 EUR
  [p]  0 EUR = 1 EUR
